## Chapter 31: The Hydra's Siphon
The deep interior of Sub-Dungeon 4 felt like stepping into an active volcanic fault line drenched in dark magic.
The **Void-Scale Hydra (Tier-B Elite)** rested inside the artificial mana-siphon pool. Its three massive, serpentine heads—each armored in thick, obsidian-hard scales—swayed rhythmically over the bubbling dark water. Corrosive purple vapor hissed from its nostrils, melting the surrounding concrete floor into slag.
**[Target Identified: Void-Scale Hydra (Tier-B Elite)]**
 * **Attributes:** Triple-Head Regeneration, Corrosive Void Breath, Tail Sweep Impact.
 * **Threat Assessment:** Lethal. Requires simultaneous multi-head destruction to prevent core regeneration.
Kaelen didn't hesitate. He stood on the rocky ledge twenty feet above the pool, his dark eyes glowing with icy focus.
"**[Lightning-Phase Blitz]**!"
*ZAP-BOOM!*
A brilliant, high-voltage arc of blue lightning erupted around Kaelen's body, instantly doubling his speed. His **93 Agility** surged into a blinding blur as he leaped off the ledge, falling straight toward the monster's central neck.
The Hydra's three heads whipped around simultaneously, letting out a deafening roar as they unleashed three concentrated streams of purple void breath.
Kaelen triggered **[Void-Step]** mid-air.
*SHHH!*
His physical frame phase-shifted into translucent shadow, passing completely through the overlapping waves of corrosive void fire unharmed.
He materialized directly on the central neck.
Planting his boots with the absolute, unyielding weight of **[Terrestrial Anchor]**, Kaelen drove a compact, 92-Strength electric straight punch directly into the central head's jaw seam.
*BOOOOOOM!*
The concussive, 100% lightning-boosted impact shattered the central head's obsidian skull plate, blasting it into a shower of gore and bone.
Before the two remaining heads could recoil or trigger their regeneration trait, Kaelen executed a lightning-fast pivot on the neck, using his **Kinetic-Void Bracers** to amplify his kinetic force. He brought his right elbow smashing down into the left head's neck, while simultaneously driving a full-power back-kick straight through the right head's eye socket.
*CRACK-BOOM!*
*CRASH!*
Both outer heads detonated from the sheer, crushing kinetic shockwave.
The colossal twenty-five-foot Hydra shuddered violently, its primary vital core shattering internally as its massive body crashed sideways into the boiling mana pool, dead in less than five seconds.
Kaelen landed lightly beside the floating carcass, his boots absorbing the impact without making a sound thanks to his **Anchor-Greaves**.
He immediately pressed both bare palms against the massive creature.
"**[Dissect & Assimilate]**!"
Dark gray vapor poured from his hands like a ravenous tidal wave, consuming the massive Tier-B Elite carcass and the surrounding mana pool in a violent, silent vortex.
**[Deconstructing Void-Scale Hydra (Tier-B Elite)...]**
**[Mass Assimilation Complete!]**
**[LEVEL UP!]**
