 * **1x Void-Scale Hydra Essence Core (Tier-B Elite)**
 * **12x Pristine Void-Scale Armor Plates (High-Tier Crafting Material)**
 * **3x Intact Hydra Fangs (Rare Essence Catalysts)**
Kaelen exhaled a long cloud of hot, purified energy. A deep, resonant thrum vibrated through his muscle fibers and skeleton as his Strength and Agility crossed the **100-point mark**.
He could feel his physical density sharpening into something far beyond standard human limits. His body was now operating at the raw power level of a senior Tier-A Vanguard.
He quickly swept the glowing Tier-B Elite core, the void-scale plates, and the rare fangs straight into his spatial salvage pouch.
Using a handful of leftover bone fragments, he scattered a few pieces near the edge of the pool to make it look like a standard dungeon mana-collapse had dissolved the carcass.
Kaelen triggered **[Void-Step]**, phase-shifting back to the upper entrance pipe.
He pulled his grease-stained utility jumpsuit back on, slouched his shoulders, grab his long steel mop, and picked up his heavy iron salvage crate filled with low-grade scrap metal.
By 04:30 AM, Kaelen walked out through the biometric turnstile, clutching his iron crate and offering a weak, tired smile to the night guard.
"A-All done with the cleanup, sir," Kaelen stammered meekly, rubbing a smudge of dirt on his cheek. "The pool in Sector 4 had a small mana-collapse, so I just swept up the bone dust."
The guard glanced at Kaelen's dirty jumpsuit and heavy scrap crate, letting out a dry, indifferent laugh. "Good job, kid. Put the mop in the rack and get out. The morning elite squads will be here in an hour."
"Thank you, sir!" Kaelen muttered, bowing his head nervously as he shuffled out into the cold morning air of Sector 2.
Underneath his loose, dirt-covered jumpsuit, Kaelen’s freshly evolved **Level 14** frame hummed with terrifying power, while his spatial pouch sat packed with high-tier cores and rare materials worth a fortune.
The night shift was over—and Kaelen had just eaten the dungeon's apex predator for breakfast.
